The function `make` is imported from the environment, so it takes and returns
WebAssembly values, and this type is not one of them:

    a

A parameter can be an `Int`, a `Float`, a `Bool`, a `String`, or one of the
types `I32`, `I64`, `F32` and `F64`. A result can be any of them but a
`String`, or `Nil`.
